  <Dialogues>k__BackingField:
  - Content: Ah traveler. The forest knows your scent now. You have walked
    DialogueActor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 70e9471fe72f4c9438024ab1165582cc, type: 2}
  - Content: What troubling you, Elder
    DialogueActor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d91ea15a4a4624644b88258d397d7967, type: 2}
  - Content: The woods whisper of decay. The Heartroot Tree our guardian bleeds black
      sap. Something dark has taken root beneath it
    DialogueActor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 70e9471fe72f4c9438024ab1165582cc, type: 2}
